# Where the POS sends sales. Defaults to a local api-vista, so nothing is needed
# for local work. Production sets https://api.vistahub.my in the Cloudflare Pages
# project settings.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000

# Set to 1 to run with no server at all, against the in-browser stand-in
# (src/lib/fake-server.ts) and the demo menu. Never set in production.
# VITE_DEMO=1
